{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Sekki 是一款重視持續性的照片飲食日記，適合希望輕鬆記錄三餐而不追求完美的用戶。透過拍攝飯前飯後照片，App 能自動依時間歸類至早餐、午餐、晚餐或點心，讓所有記錄按順序排列，無縫累積成個人化的飲食檔案。目前該 App 終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>兌換中，原價為 US $39.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-20.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能辨識與離線記錄</h2>\n<p>Sekki 具備強大的自動化功能，拍下飯前照片後會發送提醒，用戶無需打開 App 即可標示用餐結束，並支援 Siri、捷徑及主畫面小工具快速記錄。即使漏記幾餐，連續記錄機制仍能保留累計天數，每週統計聚焦於實際記錄次數而非達成率分數。此外，App 內建完全免費的食物分析功能，直接在裝置端辨識照片中的食物內容，確保用戶隱私數據不會離開手機，運動記錄亦會與餐點分開收藏，以三欄格狀呈現方便檢視。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>Sekki：照片飲食日記 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"IMG 6387\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_6387-473x1024.webp\" width=\"473\"/></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sekki：照片飲食日記</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>兌換位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/redeem?ctx=offercodes&amp;id=6755164924&amp;code=NOVE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a> （額滿即止）</li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.142575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":489,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T17:34:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:19:15.709581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:47.227560+00:00","content_hash":"5a5461b17caab88f5a4752e40dedef5d99cc530408bf10dbe9a04d5008e9cee9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}